001801  3               ;  2=QUAD HIRES
001801  3               ;  3=MONO HIRES
001801  3               ;  HIRES MODE THIRD PARAMETER
001801  3               ;  1=MIXED MODE
001801  3               ;  0=FULL SCREEN MODE
001801  3               ;
001801  3               ;__________________________________________________________
