001B80  3  AD 0F 17             LDA     PTEMPW1+1       ; Load the high byte of the first number
001B83  3  6D 13 17             ADC     PTEMPW3+1       ; Add the high byte of the second number (plus carry from previous op)
001B86  3  8D 0F 17             STA     PTEMPW1+1       ; Store the high byte of the result
001B89  3               
